  "prefLabel": "Pod 502.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 502.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the prescribing of opioids for the treatment of non-cancer and non-terminal pain, and shall not apply to the supervised administration of opioids in a health care setting.\n\nSource. #12149, eff 3-25-17; ss by #14616, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
